<div class="gis-stats"><article class="staff-panel"><small>Profil usaha</small><strong><?= number_format($total,0,',','.') ?></strong><span>Sesuai filter aktif</span></article><article class="staff-panel"><small>Titik UMKM</small><strong><?= number_format($point_count,0,',','.') ?></strong><span>Koordinat usaha yang tersedia</span></article><article class="staff-panel"><small>Titik diperiksa</small><strong><?= number_format($checked_count,0,',','.') ?></strong><span>Koordinat internal ditinjau</span></article><article class="staff-panel"><small>Calon titik</small><strong><?= number_format($candidate_count,0,',','.') ?></strong><span>Masih perlu verifikasi</span></article></div>
<div class="gis-main-grid"><section class="staff-panel gis-map-panel" id="peta-titik"><div class="gis-heading"><div><h2>Hotspot UMKM</h2><p>Titik usaha yang berdekatan bergabung saat peta dijauhkan dan terpisah saat diperbesar.</p></div><span class="gis-map-badge">Titik usaha</span></div><div class="gis-map-wrap"><div id="registry-gis-map" role="img" aria-label="Peta titik UMKM yang memiliki koordinat"></div><?php if (!$point_count): ?><div class="gis-map-empty">Belum ada koordinat usaha pada filter ini.</div><?php endif; ?></div><div class="gis-map-note"><span class="gis-dot"></span><p>Hijau: koordinat yang sudah diperiksa. Biru: koordinat internal yang belum diperiksa. Jingga: calon lokasi yang masih perlu verifikasi. Profil tanpa koordinat tetap tercatat pada panel dan daftar, tetapi tidak diberi titik perkiraan di peta.</p></div></section>
<aside class="staff-panel gis-side-panel"><h2>Jumlah profil per kecamatan</h2><p>Angka berikut mencakup seluruh profil sesuai filter, termasuk yang belum memiliki koordinat.</p><?php if (!$areas): ?><p>Tidak ada profil yang cocok dengan filter.</p><?php else: ?><div class="gis-rank-list"><?php foreach($areas as $i=>$area): ?><a href="<?= site_url('pengelola/peta-umkm').'?'.http_build_query(array_merge($filters,array('district'=>$area['id'],'village'=>0,'page'=>1))) ?>"><span><?= $i+1 ?></span><strong><?= html_escape($area['name']) ?></strong><b><?= number_format((int)$area['business_count'],0,',','.') ?></b></a><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?></aside></div>
<div class="gis-detail-grid"><section class="staff-panel"><h2>Skala usaha</h2><?php if (!$scale_counts): ?><p>Belum ada data pada pilihan ini.</p><?php else: ?><div class="gis-bars"><?php foreach($scale_counts as $item): ?><div><div class="gis-bar-label"><span><?= html_escape($item['label']) ?></span><strong><?= number_format((int)$item['business_count'],0,',','.') ?></strong></div><div class="gis-bar-track"><span style="width:<?= $total?max(1,round(100*(int)$item['business_count']/$total,1)):0 ?>%"></span></div></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?></section><section class="staff-panel"><h2>Kelengkapan lokasi</h2><dl class="staff-facts"><div><dt>Memiliki koordinat</dt><dd><?= number_format($point_count,0,',','.') ?> profil</dd></div><div><dt>Belum ada koordinat</dt><dd><?= number_format(max(0,$total-$point_count),0,',','.') ?> profil</dd></div><div><dt>Desa belum tercatat</dt><dd><?= number_format((int)$summary['without_village'],0,',','.') ?> profil</dd></div></dl><p>Titik pada peta hanya tersedia untuk usaha dengan koordinat. Calon titik memerlukan pemeriksaan sebelum dianggap sebagai lokasi usaha.</p></section></div>
<section class="staff-panel"><div class="gis-heading"><div><h2>Profil sesuai filter</h2><p><?= number_format($total,0,',','.') ?> profil. Gunakan daftar ini untuk membuka rincian registri.</p></div></div><?php if (!$rows): ?><p>Profil tidak ditemukan.</p><?php else: ?><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Usaha</th><th>Wilayah</th><th>Skala</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($rows as $row): ?><tr><td><strong><?= html_escape($row['name']) ?></strong></td><td><?= html_escape(($row['village_name']?$row['village_name'].', ':'').$row['district_name']) ?></td><td><?= html_escape($row['scale_name']?:'Belum tercatat') ?></td><td><?= html_escape(array('imported_unverified'=>'Belum diverifikasi','reviewed'=>'Ditinjau','draft'=>'Draf')[$row['registry_status']]??$row['registry_status']) ?></td><td><a href="<?= site_url('pengelola/registri/'.$row['id']) ?>">Detail →</a></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php endif; ?><?php $this->load->view('staff/_pagination',array('base'=>site_url('pengelola/peta-umkm'),'params'=>$filters,'page'=>$page,'pages'=>$pages)); ?></section>
<script src="<?= base_url('assets/leaflet/leaflet.js') ?>"></script>
<script src="<?= base_url('assets/leaflet/markercluster/leaflet.markercluster.js') ?>"></script>
<script>
(function(){
  const form=document.getElementById('gis-filter');const district=document.getElementById('gis-district');const village=document.getElementById('gis-village');
  district.addEventListener('change',function(){village.value='';form.submit();});
  const points=<?= json_encode($map_points,JSON_HEX_TAG|JSON_HEX_AMP|JSON_HEX_APOS|JSON_HEX_QUOT) ?>;
  const detailBase=<?= json_encode(site_url('pengelola/registri'),JSON_HEX_TAG|JSON_HEX_AMP|JSON_HEX_APOS|JSON_HEX_QUOT) ?>;
  const map=L.map('registry-gis-map',{scrollWheelZoom:false}).setView([-6.75,111.45],10);
  L.tileLayer('https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png',{maxZoom:18,attribution:'&copy; <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors'}).addTo(map);
  const cluster=L.markerClusterGroup({chunkedLoading:true,showCoverageOnHover:false,maxClusterRadius:66,spiderfyOnMaxZoom:true,
    iconCreateFunction:function(group){const n=group.getChildCount();const size=n<10?42:n<100?50:58;return L.divIcon({html:'<span>'+n.toLocaleString('id-ID')+'</span>',className:'gis-cluster-icon',iconSize:[size,size]});}});
  for(const point of points){
    const marker=L.marker([point.lat,point.lng],{icon:L.divIcon({html:'<span></span>',className:'gis-business-pin '+point.kind,iconSize:[22,22],iconAnchor:[11,11]})});
    const popup=document.createElement('div');const title=document.createElement('strong');title.textContent=point.name;popup.appendChild(title);
    const place=document.createElement('p');place.textContent=[point.village,point.district].filter(Boolean).join(', ');popup.appendChild(place);
    const state=document.createElement('p');state.textContent=point.kind==='checked'?'Koordinat telah diperiksa':point.kind==='candidate'?'Calon lokasi dari '+(point.source||'sumber luar')+'; belum diverifikasi':'Koordinat internal belum diperiksa';popup.appendChild(state);
    const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=detailBase+'/'+point.id;link.textContent='Lihat profil usaha →';popup.appendChild(link);
    marker.bindPopup(popup);cluster.addLayer(marker);
  }
  map.addLayer(cluster);
  if(points.length>1)map.fitBounds(cluster.getBounds(),{padding:[36,36],maxZoom:13});else if(points.length===1)map.setView([points[0].lat,points[0].lng],13);
})();
</script>
